{{JPExclusive}}
'''Dragon League Witch''' (ドラリー魔法使い ''Dorarī Mahōtsukai'') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in the [[Dragon League Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 3.1.1 Update|Version 3.1.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dragon League Witch
|appearance = [[Dragon League Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500円 - 5,925円
|image = E 121.png
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy deals high damage at a quite comfortable standing range; however, it has barely any health (only 2,500 at its strongest appearance), a sluggish attack rate and a very high money drop.

==Strategy==
[[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] are effective against this enemy.

